# Imported architecture pages are regenerated verbatim by
# `npm run import:architectures` and embed JSX component props (e.g.
# CNCFProjectCard description={"..."}) inline in prose. Prettier's markdown
# formatter rewraps that prose across lines, which breaks the JS string
# literal and fails the MDX build with "Could not parse expression with acorn"
# (see #681, #795); any local reformatting would also be overwritten by the
# next import anyway. Excludes every generated org page but keeps the
# hand-authored index.
docs/architectures/*.md
!docs/architectures/index.md
# Workflow file: formatting it requires a credential with the Workflows permission:
.github/workflows/create-milestones.yml
# Blog posts contain MDX JSX comments ({/* truncate */}) that prettier's markdown
# parser mangles into {/_ _/}, breaking Docusaurus truncation and SSG:
blog/
